      "source": "Base class for <a href=\"RelationalConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.conversion\"><code>RelationalConverter</code></a> implementations. Sets up a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/ConfigurableConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>ConfigurableConversionService</code></a> and\npopulates basic converters. Allows registering <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>RelationalConverter</code> 实现的基础类。配置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/support/ConfigurableConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.support\"><code>ConfigurableConversionService</code></a> 并填充基本转换器。允许注册 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/convert/CustomConversions.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>CustomConversions</code></a>。",
